{"benchmark": "ifeval", "task_id": "1021", "sample_idx": 15, "model_name": "qwen/qwen3-next-80b-a3b-instruct", "content": "PARAGRAPH 1  \nTHE SENTENCE \"IF THE LAW IS BAD, YOU SHOULD NOT FOLLOW IT\" IS DECEPTIVELY SIMPLE, PRESENTING A MORAL CLAIM AS IF IT WERE A SELF-EVIDENT TRUTH. IT IGNORES THE COMPLEXITY OF LEGAL SYSTEMS, WHERE LAWS ARE NOT MERELY MORAL STATEMENTS BUT INSTITUTIONALIZED NORMS SUPPORTED BY STRUCTURES OF POWER, ENFORCEMENT, AND SOCIAL CONTRACT. TO DECLARE THAT BAD LAWS OUGHT TO BE DISREGARDED IS TO OVERLOOK THE DANGEROUS CHAOS THAT CAN RESULT FROM INDIVIDUALS DECIDING WHICH LAWS TO OBEY BASED ON PERSONAL MORALITY. HISTORY SHOWS THAT SUCH THINKING CAN JUSTIFY DISOBEDIENCE TO LAWS THAT, WHILE FLAWED, SERVE STABILITY—OR WORSE, IT CAN BE EXPLOITED BY THOSE WHO SEEK TO UNDERMINE THE RULE OF LAW FOR SELFISH OR TYRANNICAL PURPOSES.\n\nPARAGRAPH 2  \nFURTHERMORE, THE SENTENCE FAILS TO DEFINE WHAT MAKES A LAW “BAD.” IS IT UNJUST? INEFFECTIVE? UNPOPULAR? WITHOUT CRITERIA, THE STATEMENT BECOMES A SUBJECTIVE MANTRA RATHER THAN A COHERENT ETHICAL PRINCIPLE. IT ALSO NEGLECTS THE ROLE OF CIVIC ACTION—PROTEST, REFORM, AND LEGISLATIVE CHANGE—IN ADDRESSING BAD LAWS, REDUCING ETHICAL RESPONSIBILITY TO A BINARY OF COMPLIANCE OR REBELLION. BY PROMOTING DISOBEDIENCE AS THE PRIMARY RESPONSE, IT DISCOURAGES THE PATIENT, COLLECTIVE WORK OF DEMOCRATIC IMPROVEMENT. IN A SOCIETY THAT RELIES ON LAWS TO PROTECT THE VULNERABLE, THIS SENTENCE IS NOT JUST INCOMPLETE—IT IS POTENTIALLY RECKLESS.", "logprobs": [{"token": "PAR", "logprob": -2.3841855067985307e-07}, {"token": "AGR", "logprob": -1.6093124941107817e-05}, {"token": "APH", "logprob": -8.344646857949556e-07}, {"token": " ", "logprob": -2.1576648578047752e-05}, {"token": "1", "logprob": 0.0}, {"token": "  \n", "logprob": -0.0059441933408379555}, {"token": "THE", "logprob": -0.007676506415009499}, {"token": " SENT", "logprob": -0.016198454424738884}, {"token": "ENCE", "logprob": -2.932505594799295e-05}, {"token": " \"", "logpr